OL,3,GNEWSANo probe into claims Swinney
OL,4,Amisled Holyrood
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister will not be
OL,7,Finvestigated over allegations he
OL,8,Fbreached the ministerial code by
OL,9,Fmisleading parliament during an
OL,10,Fexchange over pensions.
OL,12,FJohn Swinney said independent advisers
OL,13,Fhave found no probe is necessary
OL,14,Ffollowing his claim at first minister's
OL,15,Fquestions that people would "lose their
OL,16,Fpensions" if the UK government's plan
OL,17,Fto reform the triple lock went ahead.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
