OL,3,GNEWSANo probe into claims Swinney
OL,4,Amisled Holyrood
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish Conservative leader Russell
OL,7,FFindlay had accused Swinney of
OL,8,F"scaremongering" over the comments, and
OL,9,Furged the first minister to correct the
OL,10,Fofficial record.
OL,12,FHowever, Swinney said he now
OL,13,F"considered the matter closed"
OL,14,Ffollowing the advisers' decision.
